%% images.mgp - gucOS MagicPoint showcase (todos/0185): %newimage options
%% over the one seeded image (/usr/share/mgp/demo.gif; giflib first-frame).
%deffont "standard" tfont "/usr/share/fonts/mono.ttf"
%default 1 area 90 90, size 2, fore "white", back "gray20", font "standard"
%default 2 size 9, vgap 20, prefix " ", center
%default 3 size 5, fore "yellow", vgap 30
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Images

zoom, stretch, rotate
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Natural size

%center
%newimage "/usr/share/mgp/demo.gif"
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Zoomed

%center
%newimage -zoom 60 "/usr/share/mgp/demo.gif"
%size 3, fore "gray70", center
-zoom 60: both axes to 60% of the original
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Stretched

%center
%newimage -xyzoom 160 50 "/usr/share/mgp/demo.gif"
%size 3, fore "gray70", center
-xyzoom 160 50: axes scale independently
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Rotated

%center
%newimage -rotate 90 "/usr/share/mgp/demo.gif"
%size 3, fore "gray70", center
-rotate 90: quarter turns (0, 90, 180, 270)
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Inline with text

%size 4, fore "white", left
images sit in the text flow:
%center
%newimage -zoom 40 "/usr/share/mgp/demo.gif"
%size 4, fore "white", left
so captions read naturally around them
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

The end

%size 4, center
next: backgrounds.mgp
